{
  "id": "25531_shorisuru",
  "headword": "{処理|しょり}する",
  "reading": "しょりする",
  "romaji": "shorisuru",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "to handle; to process; to deal with",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to handle; to process; to deal with; to take care of",
      "explanation": "To manage, organize, or work through a task, problem, or item that requires action, often in a systematic or procedural way."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "25531_shorisuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "データを{処理|しょり}する。",
      "english": "I process the data.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "25531_shorisuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{大量|たいりょう}の{書類|しょるい}を{処理|しょり}しなければならない。",
      "english": "I have to process a large volume of documents.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "25531_shorisuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "この{問題|もんだい}は{早急|さっきゅう}に{処理|しょり}する{必要|ひつよう}がある。",
      "english": "This problem needs to be dealt with urgently.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "{処理|しょり}する implies methodical, often routine handling of tasks, data, or problems. It is widely used in both business and technical contexts. The nuance is pragmatic and efficient — getting things done — rather than creative or emotional.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- データを{処理|しょり}する: process data\n- {情報|じょうほう}を{処理|しょり}する: process information\n- ゴミを{処理|しょり}する: dispose of garbage\n- {事務|じむ}{処理|しょり}: office work; clerical processing\n- {画像|がぞう}{処理|しょり}: image processing\n- {処理|しょり}{速度|そくど}: processing speed\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {対処|たいしょ}する: to cope with; to deal with — emphasizes responding to a problem or situation, often something unexpected\n- {扱|あつか}う: to handle; to deal with — broader, includes physical handling and treating people or topics\n- {解決|かいけつ}する: to solve; to resolve — focuses on reaching a solution, not the process of handling",
